  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 450°F."
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain and rinse chickpeas. Place on paper towels and pat dry."
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel and thinly slice onion into half rings. Wash and halve tomatoes."
    },
    {
      "text": "Place chickpeas, onion, and tomatoes on a baking sheet pan. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat."
    },
    {
      "text": "Place in the oven and roast until chickpeas are golden and tomatoes begin to collapse, 10-15 minutes."
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel and mince garlic. In a small bowl, prepare dressing by whisking together garlic, lemon juice, olive oil, Dijon, oregano, salt, and pepper."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry arugula. Transfer to a large bowl."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add chickpeas, onion, tomatoes, and feta to bowl with arugula and toss."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, arrange salad on a plate and drizzle with dressing. Enjoy!"
    }
  ]
